suggestions.sketch:
Create a new class src.application.report_service.ReportService that receives OrderRepository and EmailClient via its constructor and implements methods count_orders() and send_summary(address). Refactor ReportView to depend only on ReportService (injection) and remove direct imports of EmailClient and OrderRepository. Example:

class ReportService:
    def __init__(self, repository: OrderRepository, mailer: EmailClient):
        self._repository = repository
        self._mailer = mailer
    def count_orders(self) -> int:
        return self._repository.count()
    def send_summary(self, address: str) -> dict[str, str]:
        return self._mailer.send(address, f"{self._repository.count()} orders")

class ReportView:
    def __init__(self, service: ReportService):
        self._service = service
        self._width = 40
    ...
    def order_count(self) -> int:
        return self._service.count_orders()
    def mail_summary(self, address: str) -> dict[str, str]:
        return self._service.send_summary(address)

